on exitFrame
  [  0] pushsymb 20 ............................. <#stop>
  [  2] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [  7] extcall 3 ............................... sound stop 2
  [  9] pushsymb 20 ............................. <#stop>
  [ 11] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <3>
  [ 16] extcall 3 ............................... sound stop 3
  [ 18] ret
end
